=========================================
🔥 STL Iterator Types (VERY IMPORTANT)
=========================================

1. What is an Iterator?
------------------------
- An iterator is an object that points to an element in a container.
- Works like a generalized pointer.
- Used to traverse STL containers uniformly.

Example:
vector<int>::iterator it;

=========================================================
C++ STL CONTAINERS VS ITERATOR TYPES
=========================================================

| Container              | Category                  | Internal Data Structure       | Iterator Type        |
|------------------------|---------------------------|-------------------------------|----------------------|
| std::array              | Sequence Container         | Fixed Array                    | Random Access        |
| std::vector             | Sequence Container         | Dynamic Array                  | Random Access        |
| std::deque              | Sequence Container         | Segmented Array                | Random Access        |
| std::list               | Sequence Container         | Doubly Linked List             | Bidirectional        |
| std::forward_list       | Sequence Container         | Singly Linked List             | Forward              |
|------------------------|---------------------------|-------------------------------|----------------------|
| std::map                | Ordered Associative        | Red-Black Tree                 | Bidirectional        |
| std::multimap           | Ordered Associative        | Red-Black Tree                 | Bidirectional        |
| std::set                | Ordered Associative        | Red-Black Tree                 | Bidirectional        |
| std::multiset           | Ordered Associative        | Red-Black Tree                 | Bidirectional        |
|------------------------|---------------------------|-------------------------------|----------------------|
| std::unordered_map      | Unordered Associative      | Hash Table                     | Forward              |
| std::unordered_multimap | Unordered Associative      | Hash Table                     | Forward              |
| std::unordered_set      | Unordered Associative      | Hash Table                     | Forward              |
| std::unordered_multiset | Unordered Associative      | Hash Table                     | Forward              |
|------------------------|---------------------------|-------------------------------|----------------------|
| std::stack              | Container Adaptor          | deque (default)                | Not Exposed          |
| std::queue              | Container Adaptor          | deque (default)                | Not Exposed          |
| std::priority_queue     | Container Adaptor          | vector + Heap                  | Not Exposed          |

